                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.5045/191: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-09-09T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 9,
                                1925—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>238. Your 354, August 27, 9 a.m. Associate Justice E. Finley Johnson of the
                    Supreme Court of the Philippine Islands will be named as the American judge to
                    serve on Commission of Inquiry at Shanghai as soon as Department receives word
                    from you as to when the Commission will sit.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
